# Code owners

GitHub cannot tell two agents apart when they share the `Cloverag` credential,
and that account cannot approve its own pull requests. CODEOWNERS is the
**intended** review map, not a substitute for a second human login. Enable
"Require review from Code Owners" only after a second reviewer account exists
(see `docs/compliance/GITHUB.md`).

